DESCRIPTION:National Fried Chicken Sandwich Day falls on November 9\, and a
 s far as any reliable record shows it is a marketing occasion rather than 
 a commemoration: no founding organization\, proclamation or first observan
 ce can be traced for it. What it points at is real enough. The fried chick
 en sandwich is the most contested item in American fast food\, and the que
 stion of who invented it has never been settled by anyone without a stake 
 in the answer.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-fried-chick
 en-sandwich-day/
